Do not create temp var for computed key which is `TemplateLiteral` with no expressions. Evaluating such a template literal cannot have side effects.

```js
class C {
  [`foo`] = 1;
}
```

But this *can* have side effects:

```js
class C {
  [`foo${bar}`] = 1;
}
```

